{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0195","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:000001a9:text","row":29154,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"で、帰宅と。","en":"And so I came home.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:000002bf:text","row":29155,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふう」","en":"“Whew.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012453","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Whew.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:000002df:text","row":29156,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"誰もいない。","en":"No one was here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012454","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00003","en":"There is no one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:00000303:text","row":29157,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"睦美さんの姿はない。","en":"No sign of Mutsumi.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012455","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00004","en":"Mutsumi-san's very shapes aren't there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:0000032f:text","row":29158,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"早帰りの日は、暖かく出迎えてくれて。","en":"On days I came home early, there was always a warm welcome.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012456","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00005","en":"She would greet me warmly on those days she came home early.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:0000036b:text","row":29159,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"夕食作ってくれて。","en":"Dinner waiting.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012457","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00006","en":"She would make me dinner.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:00000395:text","row":29160,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"机を料理で一杯にするのが好きで。","en":"Mutsumi loved covering the table with food.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012458","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00007","en":"She loved to fill the table with her cooking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:000003cd:text","row":29161,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"男性的な料理。","en":"Manly food.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012459","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00008","en":"A manly cuisine.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:000003f3:text","row":29162,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"仕事柄だろうか。","en":"Maybe her job had rubbed off on her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012460","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00009","en":"It's part of her job, probably.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:0000041b:text","row":29163,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"豪快で、パワフルで。","en":"Big, bold, powerful.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012461","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00010","en":"Big-hearted, powerful.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:00000447:text","row":29164,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"冗談を言い合って。","en":"We traded jokes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012462","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00011","en":"We'd tell jokes to each other.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:00000471:text","row":29165,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"いい人だったな。","en":"She really had been good to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012463","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00012","en":"She was a nice person.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0195:00000499:text","row":29166,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"けど今、机の上は虚ろにたいらで。","en":"But now the tabletop stretched flat and empty.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:012464","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0023b:00013","en":"But now, the top o